@track evocation
# en: Evocation
name [ade249] = 塑能术
# en: Evocation I, Evocation II, Advanced Evocation
level_names [bc7426] = 塑能术 I、塑能术 II、高等塑能术
# en: Fire and water, called up and held. Pyromancy and Tidecalling, taught together because they keep putting each other out.
desc [17db46] = 召唤并驾驭火与水。火焰术和唤潮术合在一起教，因为它们总是互相浇灭。
# en: You sign up for Evocation. The reading list comes with a note about singed eyebrows.
picked [99ef0b] = 你报了塑能术。书单后面附了一张关于眉毛烧焦的提醒。

@track astromancy
# en: Astromancy & Divination
name [f9e4fb] = 星象与占卜
# en: Astromancy I, Astromancy II, Advanced Astromancy
level_names [9c3a9b] = 星象学 I、星象学 II、高等星象学
# en: Reading the sky and the time that hasn't happened yet. Tea leaves in the first year; star charts that move in the third.
desc [74bd21] = 解读星空，以及尚未发生的时间。一年级看茶叶；三年级的星图会自己动。
# en: You sign up for Astromancy. Someone hands you a teacup and tells you not to drink from it.
picked [a1269f] = 你报了星象与占卜。有人递给你一只茶杯，叮嘱你别喝里面的东西。

@track alchemy
# en: Alchemy & Healing
name [dd40d4] = 炼金与治愈
# en: Alchemy I, Alchemy II, Advanced Alchemy
level_names [5ac82d] = 炼金学 I、炼金学 II、高等炼金学
# en: Potions, remedies and the patience to stir clockwise. Half of it happens in the laboratory and half in the infirmary.
desc [88b971] = 药剂、疗方，以及顺时针搅拌的耐心。一半在实验室里学，一半在医务室里学。
# en: You sign up for Alchemy. Your first lesson is how to stir clockwise, and why.
picked [f50cd5] = 你报了炼金与治愈。第一课是怎么顺时针搅拌，以及为什么。

@track illusion
# en: Illusion & Glamour
name [5cdf61] = 幻术与魅影
# en: Illusion I, Illusion II, Advanced Illusion
level_names [b3f52d] = 幻术 I、幻术 II、高等幻术
# en: Making people see what you choose. Professor Vey grades on whether you fooled her, and she is very hard to fool.
desc [fcaca3] = 让别人看见你选择的东西。维伊教授的评分标准是你有没有骗过她——而她很难被骗。
# en: You sign up for Illusion. Professor Vey looks at you as if you might already be one.
picked [0ae3d9] = 你报了幻术与魅影。维伊教授看你的眼神，好像你本人就可能是个幻象。

@track beastcraft
# en: Beastcraft & Flight
name [d8160a] = 驭兽与飞行
# en: Beastcraft I, Beastcraft II, Advanced Beastcraft
level_names [ff1301] = 驭兽学 I、驭兽学 II、高等驭兽学
# en: Creatures, familiars and brooms. Professor Brask believes the first two are easier to reason with than the third.
desc [4a5da1] = 生灵、使魔与扫帚。布拉斯克教授认为前两者比第三者讲道理。
# en: You sign up for Beastcraft. Your name goes on the list beside a broom and a hippogriff.
picked [39f700] = 你报了驭兽与飞行。你的名字写在名单上，旁边是一把扫帚和一只鹰头马身有翼兽。

@track umbral
# en: Umbral Theory
name [97bda7] = 暗影理论
# en: Umbral Theory I, Umbral Theory II, Advanced Umbral Theory
level_names [3a8538] = 暗影理论 I、暗影理论 II、高等暗影理论
# en: Shadow, wards and the magic of what is hidden. Taught at the top of the tower, where the lamps burn dim on purpose.
desc [418538] = 影、结界，以及隐藏之物的魔法。在塔顶讲授，那里的灯故意点得很暗。
# en: You sign up for Umbral Theory. The lamps at the top of the tower are dim on purpose.
picked [fe0dba] = 你报了暗影理论。塔顶的灯光是故意调暗的。

@track artifice
# en: Artifice
name [de3328] = 奇械术
# en: Artifice
level_names [de3328] = 奇械术
# en: Enchanted machinery: clockwork that thinks, cauldrons that stir themselves. Offered to students who already know how to make things and how to make them burn.
desc [7cb472] = 附魔机械：会思考的发条装置，会自己搅拌的坩埚。只开放给已经懂得如何造东西、也懂得东西如何着火的学生。
# en: You take the place in Artifice. Someone shows you where the fire buckets are before anything else.
picked [8435e9] = 你接下了奇械术的名额。在一切开始之前，有人先告诉你灭火桶放在哪儿。

@track starcalling
# en: Starcalling
name [7a102b] = 唤星术
# en: Starcalling
level_names [7a102b] = 唤星术
# en: Calling down the light of a named star. Not on any syllabus; taught by appointment, at night.
desc [73276b] = 召唤一颗有名字的星星的光。不在任何课表上；需预约，夜间授课。
# en: You accept the appointment for Starcalling. The first one is tonight.
picked [d972c5] = 你接受了唤星术的约见。第一次就在今晚。

@track hollow_studies
# en: Hollow Studies
name [1138df] = 空洞研究
# en: Hollow Studies
level_names [1138df] = 空洞研究
# en: What the founders sealed, and how. The headmistress teaches it herself, to very few students, in a room without windows.
desc [e6cd54] = 创始人封印了什么，又是如何封印的。院长亲自讲授，学生极少，在一间没有窗的屋子里。
# en: You accept a seat in Hollow Studies. The headmistress writes your name in a book with a black cover.
picked [10801c] = 你接受了空洞研究的席位。院长把你的名字写进一本黑色封皮的书里。

@track duelling
# en: Duelling Circle
name [d0fcd5] = 决斗社
# en: Member, Officer, Captain
ranks [b9c401] = 社员、干事、队长
# en: Practice bouts, the Spring Tournament and a great deal of shouting about footwork.
desc [cd83f9] = 练习对决、春季锦标赛，还有关于步法的大量吼叫。
# en: You join the Duelling Circle. Someone is already explaining footwork to you, loudly.
picked [5318b4] = 你加入了决斗社。已经有人在大声给你讲步法了。

@track lumen_ledger
# en: The Lumen Ledger
name [2606ae] = 《流明纪事报》社
# en: Stringer, Reporter, Editor
ranks [82cebb] = 通讯员、记者、主编
# en: The student newspaper. Scoops, deadlines, gossip columns and the occasional duty to the truth.
desc [ab972d] = 学生报纸。独家新闻、截稿日、八卦专栏，偶尔还有对真相的责任。
# en: You join the Lumen Ledger. Nessa hands you a notebook and your first deadline.
picked [2d283c] = 你加入了《流明纪事报》社。内莎递给你一个笔记本和你的第一个截稿日。

@track verdant
# en: Verdant Circle
name [7ac3fd] = 青翠社
# en: Member, Gardener, Head Gardener
ranks [cddc83] = 社员、园丁、首席园丁
# en: The greenhouse club: moonflowers, mandrakes and long talks with plants that occasionally answer.
desc [263288] = 温室社团：月光花、曼德拉草，还有和偶尔会回话的植物之间的长谈。
# en: You join the Verdant Circle. Tobias introduces you to the plants, one by one.
picked [dec315] = 你加入了青翠社。托比亚斯把植物一株一株介绍给你。

@track cartographers
# en: Midnight Cartographers
name [771e36] = 午夜制图社
# en: The club that doesn't exist, mapping the passages the castle would prefer to keep. Never offered at the Club Fair; you are invited, or you aren't.
desc [f48173] = 那个不存在的社团，专门绘制城堡宁愿藏起来的通道。社团招新会上从不出现；你要么被邀请，要么没有。

@track library_assistant
# en: Library Assistant
name [111c30] = 图书馆助理
# en: Apprentice, Clerk, Senior Clerk
ranks [e4d902] = 学徒、馆员、资深馆员
# en: Shelving books that don't want to be shelved, and keeping Footnote off the reference desk.
desc [dd4493] = 把不想被上架的书上架，并且别让“脚注”坐上参考咨询台。
# en: You sign on at the library. Your first shift is next week, and Footnote is already watching you.
picked [a968ac] = 你当上了图书馆助理。第一个班在下周，脚注已经在盯着你了。

@track tavern
# en: Server at the Gilded Newt
name [e530c9] = 镀金蝾螈酒馆侍应
# en: Server, Barkeep, Manager
ranks [a43a61] = 侍应、吧台手、经理
# en: Evening shifts behind the bar. Tips depend on charm; survival depends on remembering who ordered the spiced cider.
desc [173a67] = 吧台后的晚班。小费取决于魅力；能否活下来，取决于你记不记得是谁点了香料苹果酒。
# en: You sign on at the Gilded Newt. The landlady shows you the cellar and the back door.
picked [7077f7] = 你在镀金蝾螈酒馆当上了侍应。老板娘带你看了酒窖和后门。

@track apothecary_clerk
# en: Apothecary Clerk
name [7d9f6c] = 药铺店员
# en: Clerk, Dispenser, Assistant Apothecary
ranks [53ed21] = 店员、配药员、助理药师
# en: Counting drops and reading labels at Pell & Daughters. The wrong drawer is never just the wrong drawer.
desc [b1db1f] = 在佩尔父女药铺数药滴、认标签。拿错的抽屉，从来不只是拿错了抽屉。
# en: You sign on at Pell & Daughters. Pell shows you which drawers never to open.
picked [23e86f] = 你在佩尔父女药铺当上了店员。佩尔告诉你哪些抽屉永远别打开。

@track broom_courier
# en: Broom Courier
name [8250e5] = 飞帚信使
# en: Runner, Courier, Chief Courier
ranks [1d2734] = 跑腿、信使、首席信使
# en: Parcels, letters and the occasional live delivery, flown across the lake in all weathers.
desc [2e4f08] = 包裹、信件，偶尔还有活物，风雨无阻地飞越湖面送达。
# en: You sign on at the courier loft. They give you a satchel and a broom that pulls left.
picked [48f0a6] = 你当上了飞帚信使。他们给了你一个挎包和一把往左偏的扫帚。

@track intern_royal_library
# en: Royal Library Archives
name [df141e] = 皇家图书馆档案馆
# en: Cataloguing and research in the oldest archives of the realm.
desc [fa724c] = 在王国最古老的档案馆里编目、做研究。

@track intern_conclave
# en: Conclave Laboratory
