@track intern_alchemists
# en: Guild of Alchemists' Works
name [6d98e1] = 炼金师公会工坊
# en: Industrial alchemy at the Guild's great works.
desc [56dec3] = 在公会的大工坊里做工业炼金。

@track intern_expedition
# en: Observatory Expedition
name [fe57ea] = 观星远征
# en: A summer of sky charts on a high plateau.
desc [03b2f6] = 在高原上与星图共度一个夏天。

@track intern_field_station
# en: Beastcraft Field Station
name [939e0e] = 驭兽术野外站
# en: Tracking, tending and counting creatures on the moors.
desc [7564b3] = 在荒原上追踪、照料、清点各种生灵。

@track intern_thornwick
# en: Thornwick Exchange Lab
name [28923e] = 荆木交换实验室
# en: An exchange placement at the rival academy's illusion laboratory.
desc [51032c] = 前往对手学院的幻术实验室交换实习。

@track intern_unseen_office
# en: Office of Unseen Affairs
name [c20130] = 隐秘事务署
# en: By invitation only. Nobody applies to the Office of Unseen Affairs.
desc [55df65] = 只凭邀请。没有人会申请隐秘事务署。

@track thesis
# en: Thesis
name [187afd] = 毕业论文
# en: A year-long research project with a faculty advisor, ending in a defence before a committee of three.
desc [a30062] = 与一位教职员导师合作、为期一年的研究课题，最后在三人委员会面前答辩。
